+## Quoted regex search
+
+In the TUI search box, double quotes select case-insensitive regex matching:
+
+```text
+"mizu"                  # Exact indexed word
+"mizu.*"                # Words beginning with mizu
+".*mizu.*"              # Words containing mizu
+"mizu|water"            # Either word
+content:"mizu.*"        # Chat content only
+title:"mizu|water"      # Titles only
+id:"01a1.*"             # Session IDs beginning with 01a1
+"mizu" AND "water"      # Both words in the session
+```
+
+Unqualified patterns search titles, chat content, session IDs, and directories. Regex matches a whole indexed term: a word or emoji sequence for titles and content, or the whole value for IDs and directories. Use `.*` for a partial match. This searches the cached index; it does not scan transcript files per keystroke. Patterns cannot span separate chat words or messages. For an indexed phrase, use single quotes in the search box: `'mizu water'`.
+
+Quoted search terms and native field regex such as `content:/mizu.*/` use strict matching without fuzzy fallback. Combine them with `AND`, `OR`, and parentheses. Quoted structured filter values such as `dir:"my project"` remain literal filters. Malformed or incomplete patterns show an error; the TUI keeps the last results visible but disables resume and copy until the query succeeds. Patterns are limited to 1,024 bytes and the regex engine's complexity limit. Backslashes inside double quotes are preserved for regex escapes, such as `"mizu\d+"`.
+
+When passing a quoted regex from your shell, preserve the double quotes with outer single quotes:
+
+```bash
+fr -a codex '"mizu|water"'
+fr -a codex 'content:"mizu.*"'
+```
+
+Unquoted text and session-ID fragments keep their usual fuzzy matching.
+
+The chat preview highlights matching text with the current theme's match colors and positions the snippet near the first match. Double-quoted regex highlights whole matching words or emoji; single-quoted phrases highlight their matching text. Filters and excluded terms do not become chat highlights.
+
